"Policy compliance yes\"],\"answer_rationale\":\"Combined pricing data with available policy limits (discount ceiling) to define the lowest permissible counter‑offer; noted missing detailed policy text\",\"steps\":[\"Identified hybrid intent (pricing decision)\",\"Called DataAgent – retrieved pricing and margin fields\",\"Called RAGAgent – no policy document returned (RAG_UNAVAILABLE)\",\"Calculated maximum allowed discount (0.5% of 6.85% = 6.35%)\",\"Formulated recommendation to counter within discount limit\"]}</llm_reasoning>'}]}"}
